  <text x="240" y="375" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#1565C0">• Texture Masking (Gradient-based)</text>
  <text x="240" y="390" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#1565C0">• Overlapping Factor (C = 0.3)</text>
  
  <rect x="820" y="320" width="280" height="80" rx="8" fill="#E3F2FD" stroke="#2196F3" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="960" y="340" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#1565C0">Implementation:</text>
