  <text x="600" y="485" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="white">Choose between BilAWA and TBil filters (11×11 kernel)</text>
  
  <!-- Filter Types -->
  <rect x="50" y="530" width="320" height="120" rx="8" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#FF9800" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="210" y="550" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#E65100">BilAWA Filter:</text>
  <text x="210" y="570" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#E65100">hi,BilAWA = hg,BilAWA(x,xi) × hs,BilAWA(x,xi)</text>
  <text x="210" y="590" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#E65100">• Geometric kernel + AWA similarity</text>
  <text x="210" y="610" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#E65100">• Best for bitrate saving (19.3% avg)</text>
  <text x="210" y="630" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#E65100">• σg = 1.8, ε controlled by JND</text>
  
  <rect x="430" y="530" width="320" height="120" rx="8" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#FF9800" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="590" y="550" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#E65100">TBil Filter:</text>
  <text x="590" y="570" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#E65100">hs,TBil = min(e^(-1/2), e^(-||I(x)-I(xi)||²/2σs²))</text>
  <text x="590" y="590" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#E65100">• Thresholded bilateral approach</text>
  <text x="590" y="610" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#E65100">• Better edge preservation</text>
  <text x="590" y="630" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#E65100">• σs controlled by JND value</text>
  
  <rect x="830" y="530" width="320" height="120" rx="8" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#FF9800" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="990" y="550" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#E65100">AWA Filter (Baseline):</text>
  <text x="990" y="570" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#E65100">hi,AWA = 1/(1 + a×max(ε², ||I(x)-I(xi)||²))</text>
  <text x="990" y="590" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#E65100">• Simple thresholded weights</text>
  <text x="990" y="610" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#E65100">• 3×3 kernel for comparison</text>
  <text x="990" y="630" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#E65100">• 14.1% bitrate saving</text>
  
  <!-- Arrow -->
  <line x1="600" y1="500" x2="600" y2="680" stroke="#333" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#arrowhead)"/>
  
  <!-- Perceptual Filtering -->
  <rect x="400" y="690" width="400" height="60" rx="10" fill="url(#filterGrad)" stroke="#E65100" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="600" y="715" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="white">PERCEPTUAL FILTERING PROCESS</text>
  <text x="600" y="735" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="white">Apply JND-guided adaptive filtering to remove imperceptible details</text>
  
  <!-- Arrow -->
